1
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:52,940
Let's talk about it later.

2
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,780
What's wrong, Xingcan?

3
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,460
I was just discussing work with a colleague.

4
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:01,370
Let's leave work for tomorrow.

5
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:02,940
I need to head back now.

6
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:04,940
What happened?

7
00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:07,000
The contract for that previous case

8
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,000
must be revised and sent back today.

9
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:10,780
I'm sorry, darling.

10
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:13,200
I'll spend time with you tomorrow, okay?

11
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:16,080
Okay, I'll drive you.

12
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:17,180
No need.

13
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,200
You're so tired today.

14
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:21,380
I'll just take a taxi back later.

15
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:24,680
Bye.

16
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:36,080
Bye.

17
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:50,180
Chenyao.

18
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:51,560
Chenyao, wake up.

19
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:52,430
Chenyao.

20
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:53,880
Don't scare me.

21
00:01:55,780 --> 00:01:56,680
How is it?

22
00:02:09,740 --> 00:02:11,070
Hold on a little longer.

23
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,920
Is Chenyao feeling better?

24
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,400
I'm

25
00:02:16,020 --> 00:02:17,020
so hot.

26
00:02:19,940 --> 00:02:21,070
I'll go get some ice.

27
00:02:32,940 --> 00:02:34,540
Chenyao, Chenyao.

28
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:35,980
Wake up.

29
00:02:36,079 --> 00:02:38,040
You said you still have an unfulfilled mission.

30
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:39,880
You can't leave me.

31
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,640
Please wake up.

32
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,540
Wake up.

33
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:45,800
Chenyao.

34
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,040
Chenyao, wake up.

35
00:02:50,579 --> 00:02:52,900
Don't leave me. I beg you.

36
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:11,280
If you are in danger, blow this flute,

37
00:03:11,980 --> 00:03:12,980
and I will appear.

38
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:26,980
You're awake.

39
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,200
You're so strong.

40
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,680
Chen Yao.

41
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:33,840
Chen Yao.

42
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:37,280
Can you stop scaring me?

43
00:03:46,780 --> 00:03:48,880
Don't use your powers so easily from now on.

44
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:49,940
Do you hear me?

45
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,400
As you wish.

46
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:53,079
It was too dangerous this time.

47
00:03:53,079 --> 00:03:54,000
You scared me to death.

48
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:54,940
What powers?

49
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,360
Mind your own business.

50
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,740
What exactly happened yesterday?

51
00:03:58,740 --> 00:04:00,340
Why did Brother Chen become like this?

52
00:04:00,340 --> 00:04:01,140
And,

53
00:04:02,180 --> 00:04:03,800
why did I sleep holding the locksmith

54
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,640
on the stairs all night?

55
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:05,440
Stop asking.

56
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:08,080
From now on, when we carry out missions,

57
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,840
we must be extremely careful

58
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:11,940
to avoid this kind of danger.

59
00:04:11,940 --> 00:04:14,160
It's fine. I just need a moment to recover.

60
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,200
No.

61
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:19,279
Do you just want to finish the mission quickly

62
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,140
and leave here?

63
00:04:20,380 --> 00:04:21,339
No.

64
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:23,440
Brother Chen,

65
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,810
where are you going?

66
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:32,810
Anyway, you have to follow my orders in future missions.

67
00:04:34,180 --> 00:04:34,700
You too.

68
00:04:37,180 --> 00:04:37,980
Okay.

69
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,200
It should be the delivery. You feed him.

70
00:04:59,540 --> 00:05:01,140
We only have this one chance.

71
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,340
Let's split up now.

72
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,960
I'll go to Lingze's house first

73
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:04,840
to stall them.

74
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:13,940
Take this opportunity.

75
00:05:13,940 --> 00:05:14,470
Chen Yao,

76
00:05:14,780 --> 00:05:17,580
go to the study in Lingze's house and open the safe.

77
00:05:31,180 --> 00:05:34,220
Hurry up and set up surveillance in Lingze's office, the live broadcast room,

78
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:36,200
and the company entrance

79
00:05:36,340 --> 00:05:38,340
to cover all of Lingze's movements.

80
00:05:51,940 --> 00:05:53,580
There can't be any mistakes.

81
00:05:54,140 --> 00:05:55,340
Lure them into a trap.

82
00:05:55,540 --> 00:05:57,880
We're counting on this to bring them down.

83
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,040
My hands are full.

84
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:25,800
Hello.

85
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:27,680
Xingcan.

86
00:06:28,140 --> 00:06:29,280
Father has already arranged

87
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,610
the date of our wedding.

88
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,080
I've made an appointment at the bridal shop.

89
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,610
Come and try it on tomorrow.

90
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:38,100
Okay.

91
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:15,280
Since staying by his side is so painful,

92
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:16,740
why don't we

93
00:07:17,380 --> 00:07:18,480
change our plan?

94
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:22,260
I can do it no matter how many times we start over.

95
00:07:23,340 --> 00:07:26,140
This time is the smoothest and most effective one.

96
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:28,680
I can do it.

97
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,340
All right, I'll stay with you.

98
00:07:36,340 --> 00:07:37,540
What are you doing?

99
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,640
Why would a spirit drink alcohol?

100
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:41,500
Alcohol is very expensive, okay?

101
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:44,340
I'll drink with you.

102
00:07:44,540 --> 00:07:45,870
Just eat some ice cubes.

103
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,500
I don't need your company.

104
00:07:51,180 --> 00:07:51,980
Fine.

105
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:13,440
Hey.

106
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,280
Hey, I'm talking to you.

107
00:08:18,740 --> 00:08:19,460
Chen Yao.

108
00:08:21,980 --> 00:08:23,400
Come have a drink with me.

109
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:25,040
I don't drink.

110
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:36,740
Just have a couple of drinks with me.

111
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,980
Why would a fairy drink?

112
00:08:40,340 --> 00:08:42,000
And your wine is so expensive.

113
00:08:42,140 --> 00:08:43,140
Petty.

114
00:08:45,540 --> 00:08:47,020
Then let's play a game instead of drinking.

115
00:08:47,020 --> 00:08:47,600
No.

116
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,260
Let's play.

117
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,440
No.

118
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:57,840
I know I'm always being unreasonable.

119
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:01,940
I'm really unhappy today.

120
00:09:02,140 --> 00:09:04,200
I don't even know how to vent.

121
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:06,140
I'm sorry.

122
00:09:06,780 --> 00:09:09,710
I shouldn't have made such an unreasonable request.

123
00:09:10,540 --> 00:09:13,000
I'll try my best to be what my dad wants,

124
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:16,740
a sensible and independent child.

125
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,020
Don't say that.

126
00:09:18,020 --> 00:09:19,950
I won't cause you any more trouble.

127
00:09:20,140 --> 00:09:21,940
You've never been a bother to me.

128
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,140
Fine, I'll play with you.

129
00:09:31,140 --> 00:09:31,720
Okay.

130
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,880
Whoever laughs first loses.

131
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,020
You laughed.

132
00:09:42,020 --> 00:09:42,900
No, I didn't.

133
00:09:55,820 --> 00:09:57,400
Why do I always lose?

134
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,600
I'm not playing with you anymore.

135
00:09:58,600 --> 00:10:00,860
Are you a block of ice? No feelings at all.

136
00:10:03,540 --> 00:10:04,580
You laughed.

137
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:06,040
I haven't even started yet.

138
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:06,460
We started.

139
00:10:06,460 --> 00:10:07,200
You didn't say start.

140
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:07,860
We started.

141
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:09,620
Let me flick you.

142
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,200
I didn't lose. Why should I let you flick me?

143
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,200
You just laughed.

144
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,140
You can't cheat.

145
00:10:13,140 --> 00:10:14,280
No, I didn't.

146
00:10:14,280 --> 00:10:14,780
You.

147
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:16,900
You definitely laughed just now.

148
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:27,780
Are you okay?

149
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:32,460
You... you cheated.

150
00:10:32,460 --> 00:10:33,800
I bounced it back.

151
00:11:07,780 --> 00:11:09,600
We can still try other ways.

152
00:11:10,180 --> 00:11:11,840
No matter how many times we try,

153
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,500
as long as I'm here, it's fine.

154
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,400
No.

155
00:11:15,140 --> 00:11:16,870
I can't risk your body anymore.

156
00:11:18,740 --> 00:11:19,870
We've come this far.

157
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,040
Almost there.

158
00:11:23,340 --> 00:11:24,140
For you,

159
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:25,320
I don't mind.

160
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:25,850
Xingcan.

161
00:11:41,540 --> 00:11:44,080
This is the scene I've dreamed of the most.

162
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:49,600
You are so beautiful.

163
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,140
You,

164
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:54,380
take the best clothes in your store

165
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:55,640
and bring them all out.

166
00:11:55,940 --> 00:11:56,800
Okay, Mr. Ling.

167
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:58,340
Let her try them on one by one

168
00:11:58,340 --> 00:11:59,460
until she is satisfied. Okay.

169
00:11:59,460 --> 00:12:00,000
Okay.
